{"ASK_HORDE","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"A mass of them went past the plant, never saw so many","If you're following the tracks, check ahead. A straight path isn't a promise of an easy one"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Pray you never see one up close"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"I'd look before committing to a highway. Don't let a wide road make you careless"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Don't approach them - ever"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heard them from a mile away, saw them from two - ran"}},
