{"ASK_HORDE","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"Too many - don't try to fight 'em","A crowd broke into the mall up in Valley Station while we were cleaning it out - lost two of ours"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle,road",{"Passed a pack on the road - Revved the engine, drew them away"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"A nuisance, they hurt business"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral|world=water",{"The sound is the worst, like a river of moaning"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"A horde? a HORDE? oh God, no, please tell me you didn't see one, tell me you didn't","I heard one, from far off, a rumble, a drone, I thought it was a storm, it wasn't","I saw one, a hundred maybe more, wall to wall down the street, I ran like hell","I've heard of them, I've never seen one, and I pray I never will","Somebody said there's a big group moving through the county -- like a wave, like a flood!","T-there was a crowd at the school... a lot of them, I don't want to talk about it","A horde?! Seriously?! Where?! I can't take this","Stop... please... stop... don't... I can't"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Noise can draw them. I'd rather not test how many are listening","Seen two in the last week, both drifting, both slow, both dangerous","They move like weather, one day they're here, next day they're over the hill","Avoid the main roads, avoid the open fields, avoid the noise, that's how you avoid hordes","Last one I saw took an hour to pass. I barely dared to move"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Shh!! Don't say that word out loud, there could be more"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why? you planning on leading one here?!","Leave me out of it","Why? you want to find one?","If one was coming I'd already be gone, and I wouldn't stop to tell you"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","role=civilian_loner",{"Heard one cross the ridge two days ago, a sound like a train in the dark, then it faded"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","role=militia",{"We track them by sound, by dust, by birds, we try to stay out of their way"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","role=family_man,family_woman",{"Don't tell the kids, they'll lose sleep, I've been losing enough for all of us"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Is that a horde? Is it? tell me it isn't!","Don't say that word, it makes it real","I don't know, I don't want to know, run","Don't say that word!! DON'T say it!!"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"Even with that, a horde is a horde, don't try to shoot your way out"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I saw one","They came through the night before last","A horde sounds like thunder","I watched them cross a field","They follow noise","Stay off the road","A horde is just a lot of dead folks in a hurry","I haven't seen one","It took forty minutes to pass","I don't trust silence much anymore"},false,false,{[1]={{t="from a hill",afterMs=3500},{t="it looked like the road was moving",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="I held my breath for an hour",afterMs=3200},{t="I counted heartbeats",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="that doesn't stop",afterMs=3500},{t="that's how I knew",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="hundreds",afterMs=3200},{t="like cattle, if cattle were wrong",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="a dropped pan, a barking dog",afterMs=3500},{t="one mistake, and they're a tide",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="they love a road",afterMs=3200}},[7]={{t="that's how I try to think of it",afterMs=3500}},[8]={{t="I've heard one, and that's enough for a lifetime",afterMs=3200}},[9]={{t="I timed it",afterMs=3500},{t="I've never been so still",afterMs=3000}},[10]={{t="look for yourself too",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"A horde? Like a crowd at the fair, but with worse manners","A horde? I've seen bigger crowds at the the grocery sale, ha"}},
