{"ASK_HORDE","role=family_man,family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"Don't tell the children"},false,false,{[1]={{t="please",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"I lost my husband to a horde","A horde took the church... and everyone in it"},false,false,{[1]={{t="he went out to look",afterMs=3500},{t="they found him in the morning",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="I was late that Sunday",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Those things are a plague, a goddamn plague, and the Army sat on its hands"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"Stay close to me if you hear one -- I'll get us out of there"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Seen a horde? I've seen a hundred of them, moving like a river, all in one direction","A big one came through two days ago, left nothing standing","Hordes are the reason I keep my head down and my mouth shut","Saw one up on the hill, must've been three hundred, I took my time getting away","One minute it's quiet, next minute there's a wall of them coming at you, don't ask me how I know"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Horde? You're about to be the horde's lunch!"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I did, and I haven't slept right since, it was like a wave, endless, I'll never forget it"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Yeah, heard a big group on the edge of town, shuffling, moaning, like a bad dream","They came through the neighborhood two nights back, we hid in the basement for hours","Hordes follow noise, so keep it down, that's my advice","My cousin saw a whole crowd of them near the interstate, thousands, he said"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Seen a horde? I'm looking at one, and it's your face"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I got lucky, {g:man|lady}, lucky, the horde missed us by a block"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Rode through one once, don't ask how... never again","They gather like a flock, follow the lead, scatter when there's a commotion"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"You'll be lucky if you're not part of the next one"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"{g:Brother|Sister}, you see one, you run, no hero crap"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I've heard reports of several large gatherings, though I haven't confirmed any","Horde's bad, but not knowing where it is, that's what keeps me up","Noise draws them, so I advise silence"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I'd like to know where they are as much as you would"}},
