{"ASK_HORDE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Followed one by the smell for a day, kept my distance","The woods swallow them up, but in the open they're a wall","They roam, drift, and gather wherever the noise is loudest"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Saw one at a distance, it was awful, I haven't stopped shaking"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"I saw a horde at the base, the night everything broke"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"We've observed large groups moving toward populated areas, mostly following noise","Reports indicate multiple concentrations, we're avoiding them"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"Hordes follow the sound of gunfire, so keep your weapons holstered unless you need them"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Do not discuss infected movement with civilians"}},
