{"ASK_HORDE","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"We saw a big group on the far hill, moving slow, toward town","Folks said they heard hundreds in the next county, scared us half to death","Pastor says it's like Revelation, a multitude, I'd rather not think about it"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","role=militia|st=friendly",{"If a horde comes our way, we've got a plan, but I pray we never need it"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","",{"If you mean is one coming now, I'm not going to guess","A big group is something I'd rather go around than prove a point about","Tell me if you've actually seen one. I want facts before we panic","I wouldn't send you down a road on the strength of a rumor","If we spot a crowd, getting away matters more than counting it","I'm not brave about those. I'm quite happy to stay alive and embarrassed","I'd want a way out before I stopped to look at something that big","Don't turn somebody else's old report into a promise about today","We can talk about what we'd do. We don't need to pretend it's already here","If you've seen one close by, start with that. Slowly","I'd rather lose a route than get stuck trying to force it","A crowd doesn't have to be enormous to be too much for me","I'd take a detour before I'd try to impress you","If one comes our way, let's not waste time deciding whose idea it was to leave","Don't ask me to put a number on something I can't see","Tell me where your information came from before we make a plan","I can think about it without wanting to go and find one","If somebody starts saying it'll be easy, that's when I start asking questions","I don't need a heroic ending to this conversation. Getting through it will do","I'd like us to keep a way back, whatever we decide","Could be a bad situation. It doesn't get better if we stop thinking","I'm not volunteering to be the one who gets too close to find out","I'd listen to a recent firsthand report. Anything else, carefully","If there's trouble, I'd rather leave early than argue late","Keep that question practical. What have you seen, and how do we get away?","I don't want a false all clear any more than you do","I won't pretend a big crowd's harmless because I sound calm"}},
{"ASK_HORDE","st=friendly,neutral",{"I don't want to make you more frightened with a story I can't check","You can tell me you're scared. We can still decide what to do","I'd rather be cautious with you than sorry by myself"}},
