{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"T-the hospital? don't -- don't go there, it's a nightmare, it's the first place it went bad","Took my husband there with the fever and they sent us home... sent everybody home","There's a doctor in the next town, a vet actually, but he's all that's left, he does his best","The county hospital is overrun, or empty, or both, I don't know, I heard screaming, so I left","Maybe the little clinics? A nurse, a doctor, a cabinet of pills... that's about all there is"}},
