{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly",{"I'm what's left of the hospital - show me what's wrong and I'll tell you what I can do"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle,building",{"Ambulance bays got cleared first, the supply closet upstairs is still worth a look"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly",{"We laid people in the fellowship hall two days, I won't send you there - I'm sorry"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Dentist office - sounds crazy, gauze, gloves, numbing shots, nobody's been in one"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=family_elder|st=friendly|mood=sad|world=building",{"My pill bottles are in the bathroom - take the antibiotics, I'm not gonna finish 'em"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"Last report I had, the hospital in {town} was full on the eighth - that's all I've got"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral",{"I drove a girl to the emergency room on the seventh - I'd not make that drive twice"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Aid station's for unit personnel, I didn't write the rule and I can't bend it"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral,friendly",{"Our medic's got a bag and no sleep in three days - ask him nice, he'll look at you"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=elite|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Hospitals are full of the sick, think about what that means before you walk in"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=club|st=neutral",{"Club's got a woman who was an ER nurse, she'll sew you - she won't be gentle"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"I know where the pharmacy stock went, that's a different talk with a price on it"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=mercenary|st=neutral",{"I carry a clotting sponge and two bandages, they're expensive and they're mine"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"First aid cabinet in every plant in the county, better stocked than any house"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral",{"Don't go to a hospital, go where an old person lived, that's where medicine is"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|mood=fear",{"You hurt? Don't-- don't show me... I can't look at it... I'm sorry... I can't!"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"I don't go where people go, sick people go to hospitals - do that arithmetic"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=law_trooper|st=careful",{"I'm not escorting anybody - ask me when you're actually bleeding and I'll think harder"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=swat|st=careful",{"No confirmed medical site, I won't guess at one with somebody's life riding on it"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=deserter|st=careful,neutral",{"There's a triage tent at the cordon, they take your name first, temperature second"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=militia|st=careful",{"Glenda does the doctoring here and she don't see strangers - her rule, not mine"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|mood=fear",{"My boy's got a fever and I can't tell if it's the sickness or just a fever... so"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=raider|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"You're hurt? Aw - let me see, no, come here - let me see it"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Ain't no hospital, there's a room with a bucket and somebody who owes you nothing"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","role=raider_boss|tmp=predator|st=hostile|world=vehicle",{"I know where a doctor is, he works for us now - costs a truck to see him"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Infirmary - yeah, I know what an infirmary is when nobody's watching"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=hostile",{"Don't ask me that, everybody who ever asked me that is dead - every one of 'em"}},
{"ASK_HOSPITAL","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned|st=hostile",{"There's no hospital, there's you, a needle, and whatever you can boil"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,7",{"Hit the head, bullet, bat, hammer - doesn't matter, the brain has to go","Aim for the head, anywhere else, they keep coming","Stab or smash the skull - don't hesitate, they aren't human anymore","One shot to the head - don't waste a second round if the first lands"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,7",{"The head. You've got to hit the head"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"The head! you have to hit the head, that's the only thing that works, I don't know why, just the head, the HEAD","I hit one with a pan, in the chest, three times, it just kept coming, so I hit its head, and it stopped","Hit hard and don't stop, that's the only advice I've got, hard and don't stop!","I've never killed one, I've run from all of them, so don't ask me, ask someone braver","S-something heavy, a bat, a pipe, a hammer, and aim for the skull, and look away after, don't look at the face","It took me four swings the first time, my arms were shaking so bad, you'd think I'd never held a bat","Stab the temple, or the base of the skull, a friend showed me, but you've got to get close, and I can't get close"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Head shot, clean, quiet if you can, a knife through the ear if you're brave, a bat if you're strong","Keep them off your arms, one at a time only, and for God's sake don't get bit","Use the environment -- a door, a table, a step, make them trip, then finish it","Quiet works better, a blade, a hammer, a swing at the right spot, guns bring more","Take the first one down fast... and the rest will hesitate, no, they won't, they never hesitate, just do it","Just a chore now, you do it, clean up, wash, eat, sleep, like nothing happened","Aim for the brain stem, the base of the skull, one blow, one chance"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Come on, I'll show you, watch my hands","Ugly business... watch their hands, hit the head, forget everything else"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why? who are you planning to kill?!","I'm not telling a stranger how to take a life","Same way you'd handle anything coming at you, I'm watching you, so keep that in mind"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=civilian_loner",{"Bow, if you've got one, or a good axe, or a wire if you can get behind them, they don't turn fast"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=rescue_medical",{"Anatomy, my friend, the skull is thinnest at the temple, the brain stem is exposed from below, I wish I didn't know"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=rescue_clergy",{"I pray for each one I put down, and I'm never sure it's enough"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Axe, halligan, anything with an edge or a weight, the head is the target, and nothing else matters"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=militia",{"Front sight, center mass- no, HEAD, always the head, and don't waste rounds"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Destroy the brain, that's the only way I've seen, the temple, the base of the skull, the soft spot","I won't teach you how, but I'll say this, don't go for the heart, it doesn't work"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"I heal -- I don't kill, ask someone else"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral",{"A bow... if you've got one, is silent","Hit the head, hit it hard, hit it once"},false,false,{[1]={{t="a knife through the ear, if you've got the nerve",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="don't dance with them",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"Figure it out"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"You don't want to learn it..."},false,false,{[1]={{t="...but you will",afterMs=3500},{t="and you'll hate it..",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Hit them hard, in the head, and enjoy it a little, they took EVERYTHING"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"I- I can't, I just can't, I close my eyes, I swing, I pray"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"I'll show you, gently, gently, you'll get the hang of it"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"The head... the head... THE HEAD"},false,false,{[1]={{t="class dismissed",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"You aim for the head, genius, the brain's the only thing that matters, the rest just keeps walking","Hit 'em hard and hit 'em once, don't waste time, don't waste bullets, a bat through the skull does it","You really gotta ask? Pointy end goes in the eye, then you twist, I've done it a hundred times","Stay calm, panic's what gets you bit - one, two, three, swing","Cut the legs first if you're scared, then finish it, they can't chase what can't stand","Something heavy, pipe or a wrench - guns are loud and noise brings more of 'em"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"You wanna learn how to kill? Stand still, let me show you!"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? I hate it every time, the sound it makes, but you aim for the temple, it's thinnest there","First time I did it, I threw up for an hour, you get used to it... you shouldn't, but you do"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Headshot, always headshot, don't ask me twice","Use a bat if you got one, it's quiet and it works, swing like you're hitting a home run","Don't fight 'em in the open, back into a corner, make them come one at a time","My boy Terrence taught me, tire iron, never flinched once"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"You wanna know how to kill? Come at me and find out!"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Keep it quick, don't make them suffer, I know they're dead but it still feels wrong"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"A hatchet works wonders, {g:brother|sister}, one clean blow to the crown","Don't empty your magazine, one round, one skull, count 'em like gold","Get a pole or a spear, keep 'em at arm's length, getting grabbed is the worst"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Teach you? Grab something and find out the hard way"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=club|st=friendly",{"I'd tell you to be careful, but you already look like you know, keep your head about you"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Efficiency is key, a single shot to the head, no theatrics","I prefer to delegate, but if I must, a sharp blade to the base of the skull","Avoid unnecessary violence, it attracts more problems than it solves"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"If you want advice, never fight alone, always have an exit"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Shank 'em in the back of the head, that's what we did in the yard, same principle","Hit 'em hard and run, don't stay to see if it worked","I don't kill, I avoid, but if I have to, I close my eyes and swing"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't ask me about killing, I can't stop thinking about it!"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"It's terrible, I'm sorry, it's the worst thing, but you have to do it, quickly and cleanly"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"A hunter's trick: slow breath, steady hands, aim between the eyes, don't flinch","Take the head, always the head, leave the rest for the crows","Arrow or bolt, quiet and clean, a rifle's loud and draws the pack"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"It never gets easy, friend, and it shouldn't, but you learn to do it right"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Center mass won't do it, aim for the head, I learned that the hard way","Use a baton or a blunt weapon if you can, firearms attract attention","Controlled breathing, steady stance, squeeze don't pull, same as range training"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=law|st=hostile",{"That's not a question you should be asking an officer!"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=law|st=friendly",{"It's the worst part of this, honestly, aim true and try not to look at their faces"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Double tap to the head, controlled pair, then reassess","Conserve ammunition, use a blade at close range","Maintain distance, fire from cover, fall back to reload"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=military|st=hostile",{"That's classified training, civilian"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=military|st=friendly",{"It's not pleasant, but you get used to the routine, aim small, miss small"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"They told us aim for the head, but when it's your friend, I-- I couldn't, I froze"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Shotgun or a good axe, either one works, aim for the neck","We use pitchforks for the stragglers, long reach, quiet work"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Pray first, then do it quickly, the Lord understands necessity"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"The head, you have to hit the head - I hit one in the chest with a shovel four times and it just kept... the head - please remember","I don't kill them, I run, I'm sorry, I know that's no answer","Somebody said you hit them hard in the head, like splitting wood - I've never split wood - have you?"},false,{[3]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|sex=f",{"My husband said the brain, he used a hammer, I can't do it - I close my eyes, and then I can't"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Head, anything else just makes them mad, anything else is exercise","Hammer, crowbar, bat, whatever's in your hand, swing at the temple and step back after - they fall toward you"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Knock 'em down first, then finish the head on the ground - standing up, they grab"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,9999",{"Don't fight three, fight one, three times - back up till they string out in a line"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|day=6,9999",{"You don't know how to kill them? Then how are you still alive? Something's off about you"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Same way I'll handle you if you don't back off"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Framing hammer, claw end if it's thin in the skull, flat end if it ain't - sorry - you asked"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle",{"Tire iron, good long reach and it doesn't bend - aim high"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Brainstem, base of the skull, where it meets the neck - anything else and they keep coming, I learned that in the ER"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=rescue|role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"Fire axe does it, so does a pry bar - put your weight behind it like you're breaching a door"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"I don't, I help the ones who have to - I hold the light, and I say a word for whoever it was"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"Center mass won't do it, {sir}, training doesn't apply - head shots only, and make each one count"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=law|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Shotgun at close range, head height - Handgun only if you can hold it steady, most folks can't"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Controlled pairs to the head, then move, standing still after you shoot is how they get you"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"I'm not training a stranger - step back"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Head shot, single round, conserve ammo, anything else is a waste for both of you"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=military|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Rifle's for distance, up close, use the stock or a blade, the noise brings more"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=military|role=soldier_green|st=friendly,neutral",{"Drill Sergeant said center mass for three months, center mass doesn't work on them - go for the head"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=elite",{"Head - Suppressed if you have it - don't shoot if you don't need to"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=military|st=careful,hostile",{"How I do it isn't your business, your business is keeping your distance"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=outlaw,raider,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Bat to the head, same as I'd do anybody - heh"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sharp thing to the ear, learned that inside, never figured I'd use it on a dead guy"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"Pop 'em in the head - save your bullets for folks who shoot back, though"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Chain wrapped round your fist, upside the head, or just ride right over 'em"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Real easy - want me to show you on somebody?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Same as a person, you'd be surprised how easy that is"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=raider,prison,gang|st=careful,hostile",{"Why, you planning on using it on us? Go ahead and try"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Head, that's all I know, a woman at the gas station told me and she was right"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral,friendly",{"Something heavy with a long handle, swing down, not across, across is how you miss"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral",{"Skull's thicker than you'd think at the front, temple and the base are softer"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=door",{"One at a time in a doorway, never in the open and never three at once"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Aim small, a head at fifteen yards is a dinner plate - don't take it past that"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=elite_delta|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Close, quiet, committed, half a swing is worse than no swing at all"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=club|st=neutral|mood=funny",{"Don't use a bat - it bounces - ask me how I know - actually, don't"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=militia|st=neutral|world=fence",{"We use a spear off the fence line, never let 'em inside arm's length - not once"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=raider,prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"You'll figure it out, or you won't, and then you're somebody else's problem"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","reg=worker,civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral,friendly",{"Have you ever done one up close? Yes or no - it changes what I tell you"},false,{[1]="ASK_HOW_KILL"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=law_deputy,rescue_medical|st=neutral|hour=16,5",{"Before I answer - are you asking because you've got to do it tonight?"},false,{[1]="ASK_HOW_KILL"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","role=soldier_nco,elite_delta,militia|st=neutral",{"Have you got a gun on you? The answer's different if you don't"},false,{[1]="ASK_HOW_KILL"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"Three days? four? I've lost count -- it's a blur, one long scream!","Since Friday -- only since Friday, can you believe it? it feels like a year","Days, just days... feels like a year already, the nights especially"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"A week, over a week, I stopped counting at nine, I'd rather not count","Since the start, since it all went wrong, I haven't slept more than an hour at a time!","Long enough that I've forgotten what a shower feels like"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,9999",{"Weeks, I've lost track, long enough that the little things have started to feel normal","Too long -- long enough to bury everyone I loved, and then a few more..","Since the start, since the first scream... I quit counting days a while ago"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Long enough to know not to trust you","Why? what do you care?","Why do you want to know?","Long enough to know better than to stand here jawing with you"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Since the first patient... the first fever, the first night shift that never ended"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Feels like a month","Long enough to forget what my kitchen smelled like","Since the Fourth...","Long enough to bury three people..","I can tell you the day","A while","Two weeks, maybe","I keep a calendar on the wall","Too long, and not long enough","Since the first night"},false,false,{[1]={{t="it's been days",afterMs=3500},{t="I stopped counting at eight",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="since the fireworks, I mean",afterMs=3200},{t="funny how that stuck",afterMs=2800}},[4]={{t="and I'm not even sure that's the number",afterMs=3500}},[5]={{t="and the hour..",afterMs=3200},{t="and the minute, if you want, I remember it all",afterMs=2800}},[6]={{t="don't ask me how long",afterMs=3500},{t="I'm tired of adding it up",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="or two years",afterMs=3200},{t="time's not the same now",afterMs=2800}},[8]={{t="with an X for each day",afterMs=3500},{t="I'm running out of wall",afterMs=3000}},[10]={{t="since I last slept right",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Long enough to learn how to cook on a coat hanger","Long enough to miss my mother-in-law, which tells you something"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Longer than I'd like, but shorter than I feared!!"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Long enough to stop counting, you?","Day {day}, and I've already outlasted a lot of people","Since the first night, when everything went to hell","Feels like a year, but it's been {day} days, give or take"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Longer than you, and I plan to outlast you too"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Day {day}, I can't believe it, you wouldn't either"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Since day one, {g:man|lady}, I woke up and the whole block was screaming","Day {day}, still here, still standing"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Long enough to not care about you"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Day {day}, {g:man|lady}, I'm so tired, aren't you?"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Since the Friday it started, I've been on the road","Day {day}, and the beer's running low"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Long enough to be done with strangers"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Day {day}, I need a shower and a steak"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Day {day}, but who's counting?","Since the beginning, I've been preparing"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Day {day}, and it's already the longest of my life"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Day {day} out here, six years in there, which one's worse? Out here","Since the walls came down"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Long enough not to trust the likes of you"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"Day {day}, I've never been this free or this scared"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Day {day}, I keep a tally on the barn wall","Long enough to learn what not to do"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Day {day}, I'm exhausted"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"Since I walked away, day {day}"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Day {day}, I've lost count of the hours","Since the first call came in, I haven't been home"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=law|st=hostile",{"That's not relevant to this conversation"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Day {day}, I haven't slept in what feels like a week"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"Day {day}, and every one of them is a year"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Since the quarantine order came down"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Day {day}, feels like forever"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Day {day}? Is it? It feels like a month"}},
{"ASK_HOW_LONG","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Day {day}, and we've held our ground every single one","Since the news went off the air"}},
