{"ASK_HOW_MANY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"J-just me -- it's just me, I wish there were more, but it's just me","Four of us... my husband, my two kids, and me, we hold hands when we sleep","Seven... and one's a baby, and one's an old man, and I'm the only one who can run!!","A dozen, maybe, I stopped counting, people come and go","Too many to feed, not enough to defend, that's the math, that's always the math","It's just me and my brother, but he's out there somewhere, so it's mostly just me","Nine, but two are sick, and one's bitten, and I'm trying NOT to count that one","Five of us... all strangers, all scared, all trying to be nice","How many of us? There's, uh, ten, maybe twelve? I lose count","Enough that you shouldn't try anything, I mean, not that you would","More than you can see, there's more inside, a lot more","Seven, but they're all really tough, really really tough"}},
{"ASK_HOW_MANY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"About twenty, give or take, depending on who's out on watch","Eight of us, and we're a good eight, we've been together since the start","We're thirty-one, and every day it's a little fewer, I'd rather not say the number","Enough to hold what we've got, not enough to take what we want","A small group, six, seven, we keep it small on purpose","Fifteen adults, nine kids, and one cat, and the cat has opinions","Eight, if you count the baby","Six healthy, two wounded, one old man who doesn't count","Enough to keep watch and not enough to relax","Fewer than we'd like, more than we can feed"}},
{"ASK_HOW_MANY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Enough to make you regret asking!","None of your business","More than you think, so don't try anything","More than you can see, that's all you're getting"}},
{"ASK_HOW_MANY","role=civilian_loner",{"One, me, myself, and I, and the dog, who counts as half"}},
{"ASK_HOW_MANY","role=family_man,family_woman",{"Seven, counting the baby, and the baby's the loudest"}},
{"ASK_HOW_MANY","role=family_elder",{"Just me, and the Lord, and the cat..."}},
{"ASK_HOW_MANY","role=militia",{"Six on the watch, twenty on the roster, and a hundred in the neighborhood we protect"}},
{"ASK_HOW_MANY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Twenty-two, and we'd all say yes to one more, if it's you","Eleven, counting the baby, and we'd squeeze you in at the table!!","Thirty, give or take, and every one of them has heard your name","Fourteen, which sounds like a lot until you try to feed them all","We're about two dozen, and growing, thanks to people like you","Seven adults, six kids, three dogs, one cat, and an ancient cow","It's a handful, nine, and we're a tight bunch, you'd fit right in","Sixteen, plus you, that makes seventeen, if you want","Just enough to hold the place, and few enough to trust each other","We were forty, now we're twenty-seven, I'll tell you the number, but not the names","Eight, and they'd all be glad to see you, truly","Counting you, it's thirteen, unlucky, we'd better find a fourteenth","Not many, but more than enough, thanks to folks like you","A few families, mostly, and a lot of kids","A dozen or so, some come, some go, all are welcome","Twenty strong, and we feel stronger with friends around","About thirty, and the number changes daily, I wish it didn't","Six, and we're like a tiny family, you'd love us!","Eighteen, and we've got room for more, if they're like you","Forty, if you count the old folks, and I do","We've lost some, but we're still twenty strong","Thirty-three, and that number is precious to me","A baker's dozen, and a stray, that's us","Right now, fifteen, but expecting company","I count heads every night, there's twenty-one, and we're all accounted for!","We're twelve, and we're a team, you'd be a good addition","Just us, five of us, and a lot of love!","A big old crowd, but it feels like family","About a score, and every one's a story","Plenty of hands, never enough hours"}},
{"ASK_HOW_MANY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best|hour=4,11",{"I keep a count, because I care: nineteen, as of this morning"}},
{"ASK_HOW_MANY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Enough to deal with you","More than you can handle","I'm NOT telling you, you'd count the exits","Why? Planning to rob us?","It doesn't matter, you'll never meet them","Enough that you'd lose","Too many for you to bother","I'm NOT that stupid","How many do you need to lose?","A lot, and every one of them knows your name!","Count the guns, not the heads","Enough to stand up to a bully","You don't need numbers, you need a conscience","The number's none of your concern!","More than enough, believe me","A crowd, and none of them like you!","Enough to make you think twice!!","It's a secret, from you especially","I don't count for you","A hundred, maybe, a thousand, who knows","All of us, ALL together, all against you!","Plenty, and we watch each other's backs","Count the footsteps behind you","Enough to hold a grudge","We're legion -- and we remember","Why? are you planning to take us on?","You'd rather not find out","I'm not giving you numbers to plan around","More than you think","Don't push your luck"}},
{"ASK_HOW_MANY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"How many of them? Too many! How many of us? Not enough!","Count the dead, not the living, it's easier","A lot, a lot, and counting"}},
